        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A short niche speed-running game with an advanced movement mechanics and hand made maps. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To celebrate my 25th birthday and to recover from burnout I made this game. In each level a part of a message I wrote is read aloud by me. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Most levels contain more than one path to reach the objective (of blowing out a candle on a birthday cake for me :D).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You Are Speed contains:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Multiple hand made levels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* A speed rating system and personal bests for every level</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* An advanced movement system that includes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sprinting </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wall-running </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Double jumping </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sliding / crouching</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grappling (as in with a grappling hook)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Speed boosts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump boosts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Launchers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Teleportation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Transforming into a flying spirit</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And all the movement tech that can be achieved by combining those..</p></li></ul>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A short niche speed-running game with an advanced movement mechanics and hand made maps. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To celebrate my 25th birthday and to recover from burnout I made this game. In each level a part of a message I wrote is read aloud by me. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Most levels contain more than one path to reach the objective (of blowing out a candle on a birthday cake for me :D).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You Are Speed contains:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Multiple hand made levels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* A speed rating system and personal bests for every level</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* An advanced movement system that includes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sprinting </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wall-running </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Double jumping </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sliding / crouching</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grappling (as in with a grappling hook)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Speed boosts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump boosts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Launchers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Teleportation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Transforming into a flying spirit</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And all the movement tech that can be achieved by combining those..</p></li></ul>",
